; trash scale): punishes committed straight-line kiting, answered by
; turning during the 18-tick lead. Reach 0.2 + 6.5x48/60 + 0.14 =
; 5.54 covers the 5.0 trigger; spawn 0.2 < 0.315 stays overlap-valid.
; Pattern id 47. All numbers [T].

